Package: ggruf
Type: Package
Title: Helpers for llama.cpp and GGUF Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Frank", "Hull", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "frankiethull@proton.me"),
    person("nobu", role = "ctb",
           comment = "AI assistant, package scaffolding and implementation"))
Description: Pure R helpers for working with llama.cpp and GGUF model
    files, with no compiled code and no bundled inference engine. Find
    GGUF models on your machine (including the llama.cpp cache and
    Ollama's blob store, resolved to real model names via Ollama
    manifests), read GGUF metadata straight from the file header, and
    start, stop, and query a local llama-server so chat tools such as
    ellmer's chat_llamacpp() have something to talk to.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    curl,
    jsonlite,
    processx
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
